│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ projected_kvpr_multistart                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the current-state greedy choice with a projected minimax choice: each candidate   │
│                          │ GPU is evaluated using its KVPR after the model is added, together with the maximum KVPR  │
│                          │ of every other GPU. This directly matches the objective rather than selecting the GPU     │
│                          │ with the lowest pre-placement pressure.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The edit also tries several inexpensive deterministic model orderings. Model placement is │
│                          │ a constrained bin-packing problem, so a single ordering can create memory fragmentation   │
│                          │ or a poor local balance. Selecting the best feasible result among pressure-first,         │
│                          │ size-first, pressure-density-first, and combined-demand-first orderings improves solution │
│                          │ quality while retaining simple, bounded greedy execution.                                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0252                                                                                   │
