│ patch_description        │ This version combines the memory-safe pressure-aware greedy placement from the current    │
│                          │ implementation with the simpler pressure-based ordering from the inspiration program. It  │
│                          │ builds placements using multiple deterministic orderings (pressure-first and size-first), │
│                          │ retains the best feasible result, and then applies best-improving model moves and swaps.  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The greedy stage evaluates the maximum KVPR after each candidate assignment, rather than  │
│                          │ only the current GPU pressure. The refinement stage improves the global maximum KVPR      │
│                          │ while preserving GPU memory constraints. Multiple construction orders reduce sensitivity  │
│                          │ to model ordering and help avoid memory fragmentation.                                    │
