│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ swap_local_search                                                                         │
│ patch_description        │ Extend the existing relocation local search with pairwise model swaps. A placement can be │
│                          │ locally optimal for single-model moves because no destination has enough free memory,     │
│                          │ while exchanging a large low-pressure model with a smaller high-pressure model can        │
│                          │ rebalance both the KV demand and remaining memory. The search evaluates both feasible     │
│                          │ moves and feasible swaps, applies the best strict improvement to the maximum KVPR, and    │
│                          │ repeats until no such improvement remains. This preserves memory feasibility and directly │
│                          │ optimizes the requested minimax objective.                                                │
