│ patch_description        │ Add memory-aware greedy starting orders based on each model's standalone KVPR             │
│                          │ contribution, `pressure / (GPU_MEM_SIZE - model_size)`. A model that is both large and    │
│                          │ high request-pressure is substantially harder to place late because its remaining KV      │
│                          │ cache capacity is small. The existing pressure-first and size-first starts do not         │
│                          │ directly capture this interaction. Trying these additional deterministic orders improves  │
│                          │ the chance that local search begins in a better feasible basin, while retaining the       │
│                          │ existing placement and improvement logic.                                                 │
