│ patch_description        │ Improve local search by treating the sorted vector of GPU KVPR values as a lexicographic  │
│                          │ objective rather than considering only the single maximum KVPR. This permits neutral      │
│                          │ moves that keep the current maximum unchanged while reducing another tied bottleneck,     │
│                          │ often enabling a later move that lowers the true maximum.                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The search is also focused on GPUs currently attaining the bottleneck KVPR. This          │
│                          │ preserves objective relevance and reduces unnecessary exploration of moves between        │
│                          │ non-critical GPUs, offsetting the extra candidate comparison work.                        │
