│ patch_description        │ Add the complementary exchange neighborhood that replaces one model on a current          │
│                          │ bottleneck GPU with two models from another GPU. The existing exchange sends two          │
│                          │ bottleneck models to another GPU and receives one model; this new direction is useful     │
│                          │ when reducing the bottleneck’s load requires taking multiple low-pressure models in       │
│                          │ exchange for one high-pressure model. Every candidate uses exact post-exchange            │
│                          │ remaining-memory checks and is accepted only when it strictly improves the existing       │
│                          │ lexicographic KVPR vector, so it cannot worsen the maximum KVPR or create cycles.         │
